  translation {
    text: "Affected stops:\r\nHavana St & 40th Ave (#23420) (eastbound)\r\nSmith Rd & Havana St (Denver County Jail) (#23422) (eastbound)\r\nColorado Department of Corrections (#23423) (eastbound)\r\nSmith Rd & Havana St (#23424) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 37 get on/off buses at:\r\n40th Ave & Central Park Blvd (#34400)\r\nPeoria Station Gate B (#34495)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 37 get on/off buses at:\r\nPeoria Station Gate H (#34739)\r\nHavana St & 37th Ave (#23425)"
